SUMMARY:Members' Night at Spring Plant Sale
DESCRIPTION:Our annual in-person plant sale is a fabulous community event every spring. Find the highest quality annuals\, perennials\, herbs\, vegetables\, hanging baskets and special items all chosen by our Van Vleck Horticulturalist. \nMembers will enjoy first access to our Spring Plant Sale items on this evening and a 10% discount on all sale purchases.  Not a member? Join or renew HERE. \nInterested in finding Native Plants at our sale? Check out this informative brochure about Native Plants prepared by our partners at Bee City and Northeast Earth Coalition. \nNative Plant Benefits brochure \nWe are accepting nonperishable food donations for area food pantries. Please leave donations at the marked boxes by the check-out table. Thank you!
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/members-night-at-spring-plant-sale/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Events,Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2026/01/Spring-Plant-Sale-2026_1080x1080_Members-Preview-1.png
END:VEVENT
